        self.sensors[lct] = sensor_class

    # Similar for effector
```

3. **Discovery Protocol**: The Coherence Engine can discover available sensors and effectors by iterating over the keys in the dictionaries. Likewise, when a sensor/effector is needed, the Coherence Engine can look up the class by its LCT and instantiate it.

